### Variables
@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@customerId = cfe8b150-2f84-4ala-bdf4-923b20e34973

### Test 1: Registrar un pago válido
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "serviceProvider": "SERVICIOS ELÉCTRICOS S.A.",
  "amount": 120.50
}

### Test 2: Registrar un pago válido (agua)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "serviceProvider": "SERVICIOS DE AGUA POTABLE",
  "amount": 89.75
}

### Test 3: Registrar un pago válido (telecomunicaciones)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "serviceProvider": "ENTEL",
  "amount": 150.00
}

### Test 4: Error - Monto mayor a 1500 Bs
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "serviceProvider": "SERVICIOS ELÉCTRICOS S.A.",
  "amount": 2000.00
}

### Test 5: Error - CustomerId vacío
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "serviceProvider": "SERVICIOS ELÉCTRICOS S.A.",
  "amount": 120.50
}

### Test 6: Error - ServiceProvider vacío
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "serviceProvider": "",
  "amount": 120.50
}

### Test 7: Error - Monto en 0 o negativo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "serviceProvider": "SERVICIOS ELÉCTRICOS S.A.",
  "amount": 0
}

### Test 8: Consultar pagos de un cliente
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments?customerId={{customerId}}

### Test 9: Consultar pagos - CustomerId vacío (error)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments?customerId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Test 10: Consultar pagos con diferente cliente
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments?customerId=12345678-1234-5678-1234-567812345678

### Test 11: Registrar múltiples pagos para pruebas
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "serviceProvider": "COTEL",
  "amount": 200.00
}

### Test 12: Registrar pago máximo permitido (1500 Bs)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "serviceProvider": "SERVICIOS ELÉCTRICOS S.A.",
